=== layout: one-panel

# Topic 25: Gene guns

@body

- Another way past a plant cell wall: shoot DNA-coated particles into the tissue.
- *Particle bombardment* commonly uses microscopic gold or tungsten particles carrying DNA.
- Some delivered DNA is expressed transiently. Some may integrate; many treated cells never become transformed plants.
- The particle delivers the DNA. It does not choose a precise insertion site.

@notes

2026 topic 25; numbering authority: ../old/2026_topic_list.txt.
Prompt source: ../old/Fall_2026_Talking_Points_Set_4-Environmental_and_Synthetic.pptx, slide 69.
