=== layout: two-panels

# 25. Two delivery methods

@left

## Agrobacterium

- Uses biological DNA transfer.
- Depends on compatible tissue and transformation conditions.
- Still requires selection and verification.

@right

## Particle bombardment

- Delivers material physically.
- Can target different tissues or organelles.
- Tissue damage and insertion complexity can matter.

@notes

2026 topic 25; numbering authority: ../old/2026_topic_list.txt.
