=== layout: one-panel

# 25. Delivery is not the whole experiment

@body

- How is the plant tissue prepared, and how are DNA-coated particles made? What happens after delivery?
- Compare equipment cost, labor, efficiency, copy number, and unintended insertions with Agrobacterium.
- Which other organisms have been transformed this way? What is different when targeting a chloroplast?
- A gene gun is not a universal pass around regulation. APHIS returned to earlier processes after the 2024 court decision; check the particular organism and current rules.

@notes

2026 topic 25; numbering authority: ../old/2026_topic_list.txt.
