# 26. Vitamin A deficiency

@left

- Vitamin A supports vision, growth, and immune function.
- Deficiency can cause serious eye damage.
- Young children and pregnant women are vulnerable.
- A staple food alone may not provide a balanced diet.

@top-right

![Slide image 71](assets/lect06c-set_4_tp_chapter_12_16_material/image_071.png)

