# 26. Golden Rice

@left

![Golden and white rice](assets/lect06c-set_4_tp_chapter_12_16_material/image_073.png)

@right

- Engineered enzymes enable beta-carotene production in the grain.
- Beta-carotene is a precursor of vitamin A.
- The goal is to help address vitamin A deficiency.
- Evaluate nutritional evidence separately from market availability.

