# 26. Could corn fix its own nitrogen?

@body

- What would a cereal need besides a nitrogenase gene?
- Consider the nitrogenase components, metal cofactors, electron supply, ATP demand, and oxygen sensitivity.
- Compare moving microbial nif genes into plant cells with improving the plant's partnership with nitrogen-fixing microbes.
- How many genes are required in the particular strategy? Explain the system instead of quoting one universal number.

@notes

