# 27. Papaya and bananas

@left

## Hawaiian papaya

- Ringspot virus threatened production.
- Rainbow papaya carries virus-derived resistance.
- Who developed it, and how was resistance tested?

@right

## Export bananas

- Panama disease devastated Gros Michel production.
- Cavendish replaced it in much of the export trade.
- TR4 exposes a new vulnerability.

@notes

