=== layout: one-panel

# 27. Will we still have bananas in 50 years?

@body

- What made Gros Michel and Cavendish useful export cultivars? How does clonal propagation affect their diversity?
- Compare the original Panama-disease problem with Tropical Race 4. Which varieties are susceptible?
- Transgenic Cavendish field trials provide one approach to resistance. How would you compare it with breeding and crop diversity?
- Will one resistant variety solve the problem forever? What should growers monitor next?

@notes

