# 28. Check product, variety, country, and date

@body

| Example | Check the method |
| --- | --- |
| Milk from a cow fed GM corn | GM feed does not genetically engineer the cow. |
| Tofu or a veggie burger | Identify the soybean variety and other ingredients. |
| Papaya, squash, or apples | Engineered varieties exist; the food name alone is insufficient. |
| A new trait from selective breeding | A changed trait does not by itself establish genetic engineering. |

