=== layout: two-panels

# 30. Rearrange DNA, change the color

@left

## Cre/loxP

- Originates from bacteriophage P1.
- Site orientation affects excision or inversion.
- Engineered site combinations control which rearrangements occur.

@right

## Brainbow

- Recombination changes fluorescent-protein expression.
- Multiple copies produce color combinations.
- Trace labeled structures through image stacks.

@notes

